-- Record of the arcade content pack import already applied to the live
-- Supabase project (arcade_v1 item seed). The repo file is the record;
-- Lovable Cloud does not auto-apply it.
--
-- Source packs: scripts/packs/{quotes,emoji,sequels,trivia}.json.
-- quotes -> quote-match (120), emoji -> emoji (100), sequels ->
-- sequel-or-fake (90), trivia -> screening (90). 400 items total, 0 dropped.
--
-- quote-match and emoji items carry the answer as media_id, resolved against
-- media by exact case-insensitive title plus year within one (exact year and
-- highest vote_count win ties). Six pack titles were matched under the
-- catalog's TMDB naming rather than dropped, all verified by id at import
-- time: Harry Potter and the Sorcerer's Stone -> Philosopher's Stone
-- (movie-671), Deathly Hallows Part 2 -> Deathly Hallows: Part 2
-- (movie-12445), Monty Python's Life of Brian -> Life of Brian (movie-583),
-- National Lampoon's Animal House -> Animal House (movie-8469), Star Wars:
-- Episode I with a hyphen (movie-1893), WALL-E -> WALL·E (movie-10681).
--
-- The media_id values below are the ones that actually landed; payloads keep
-- only the game fields (quote/trap_titles, emoji/decoys,
-- title/year/real/anchor/reveal, q/choices/answer/note).

